      "audioScript": "🎧 Transcript bài nghe Part 1 (Hội thoại - 1 Giọng Nữ, 1 Giọng Nam):\nAn (Giọng Nữ):\tHi Phong, how is your first week at your new secondary school?\nPhong (Giọng Nam):\tHello An! It is exciting. The school has a big library and a large playground.\nAn (Giọng Nữ):\tWhat is your favourite subject?\nPhong (Giọng Nam):\tI like English and Science the most. The teachers are very friendly.\nAn (Giọng Nữ):\tDo you play sports after school with your new friends?\nPhong (Giọng Nam):\tYes, we often play football or badminton in the schoolyard.\n\n🎧 Transcript bài nghe Part 2 (Độc thoại):\nMy name is Mi and I live in a lovely town house with my parents and brother. Our house has six rooms: a living room, a kitchen, three bedrooms and two bathrooms. My favourite room is my bedroom because it has a big window looking over a green garden. In my bedroom, there is a comfortable bed, a study desk with a bookshelf, and a blue wardrobe. I always keep my room clean and tidy every day.",
