      "audioScript": "🎧 Transcript bài nghe Part 1 (Hội thoại - 1 Giọng Nữ, 1 Giọng Nam):\nAn (Giọng Nữ):\tHi Phong, how is your first week at your new secondary school?\nPhong (Giọng Nam):\tHello An! It is exciting. The school has a big library and a large playground.\nAn (Giọng Nữ):\tWhat is your favourite subject?\nPhong (Giọng Nam):\tI like English and Science the most. The teachers are very friendly.\nAn (Giọng Nữ):\tDo you play sports after school with your new friends?\nPhong (Giọng Nam):\tYes, we often play football or badminton in the schoolyard.\n\n🎧 Transcript bài nghe Part 2 (Độc thoại):\nMy name is Mi and I live in a lovely town house with my parents and brother. Our house has six rooms: a living room, a kitchen, three bedrooms and two bathrooms. My favourite room is my bedroom because it has a big window looking over a green garden. In my bedroom, there is a comfortable bed, a study desk with a bookshelf, and a blue wardrobe. I always keep my room clean and tidy every day.",
      "writingRubric": "1. Mở đoạn (Topic sentence): 0.25đ\n2. Phát triển ý (Supporting sentences): 0.25đ\n3. Vốn từ vựng & cấu trúc ngữ pháp phong phú: 0.25đ\n4. Độ chính xác chính tả & ngữ pháp: 0.25đ. Tổng: 1.0 điểm.",
      "sampleWritingText": "I would like to write about my new school, Dong Yen Lower Secondary School. It is located in a quiet village with fresh air and green trees. The school has three modern buildings, twenty well-equipped classrooms, a large computer room, and a green playground. My teachers are passionate, and my classmates are very friendly and supportive. I always enjoy going to school every morning.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nAt lunchtime, most students head down to the school canteen on the ground floor. The canteen serves healthy (23) ________ such as steamed rice, grilled chicken, and fresh vegetable soup. Students must stand in a (24) ________ to buy lunch tickets. The food is cooked cleanly and tastes (25) ________. After finishing lunch, everyone carries their plastic trays to the washing (26) ________. The canteen staff are always cheerful and (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nNestled in an ancient garden near the Perfume River, Mr. Tuan's house is an outstanding example of eco-friendly architecture. The house is constructed mainly from renewable bamboo, recycled brick, and local timber. Solar panels installed on the roof generate all the electricity needed for lighting and domestic appliances. Rainwater is gathered in large ceramic jars, filtered naturally through charcoal and sand, and reused for watering the organic garden. Large sliding bamboo screens allow natural ventilation to cool the house without relying on air conditioners. This thoughtful design proves that modern living can exist in complete harmony with mother nature.",
