      "audioScript": "🎧 Transcript bài nghe Part 1 (Hội thoại - 1 Giọng Nam, 1 Giọng Nữ):\nNam (Giọng Nam):\tHi Mai, what do you usually do to unwind after strenuous school hours?\nMai (Giọng Nữ):\tHello Nam! I fancy making origami crafts and helping my mother cultivate vegetables in the garden.\nNam (Giọng Nam):\tDo you participate in any school clubs?\nMai (Giọng Nữ):\tYes, I am an active member of our school's IT and English Speaking Club.\nNam (Giọng Nam):\tHow does joining the club benefit your studies?\nMai (Giọng Nữ):\tIt helps me improve my presentation skills and cope effectively with academic pressure.\n\n🎧 Transcript bài nghe Part 2 (Độc thoại):\nLife in the Vietnamese countryside offers a harmonious rhythm that contrasts sharply with the frantic pace of major metropolises. During the golden harvest season, the vast paddy fields stretch like boundless carpets of ripe rice under the radiant sunlight. Local farmers work diligently from early dawn, harvesting golden stalks and loading grain carts. In the evening, the peaceful village echoes with children's laughter as they fly paper kites on grassy dikes or cycle along winding riverbanks. The close-knit camaraderie among villagers creates a safe, caring, and tranquil living environment.",
      "writingRubric": "1. Mở đoạn (Topic sentence): 0.25đ\n2. Phát triển ý (Supporting sentences): 0.25đ\n3. Vốn từ vựng & cấu trúc ngữ pháp phong phú: 0.25đ\n4. Độ chính xác chính tả & ngữ pháp: 0.25đ. Tổng: 1.0 điểm.",
      "sampleWritingText": "Life in the countryside provides many memorable experiences and benefits. The air is always fresh, peaceful, and unpolluted compared to busy cities. People live closely together, showing great hospitality and mutual support. In addition, teenagers in rural villages often enjoy outdoor activities like flying kites on grassy dikes, swimming in clear rivers, and riding bicycles around village lanes.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nLife in the Vietnamese countryside offers an idyllic contrast to the hectic pace of modern megacities. During harvest season, expansive paddy fields transform into a radiant golden carpet under the warm autumn sun. Farmers labor tirelessly from dawn till dusk, yet they are remarkably (23) ________ and hospitable to visitors. Children in rural hamlets often fly kites on river dikes, herd water buffaloes, or swim in crystal-clear irrigation (24) ________. There is virtually no traffic congestion or industrial air (25) ________, making the atmosphere invigorating and crisp. Neighbors treat one another like extended family members, always willing to lend a helping (26) ________ during festivals or village gatherings. For those yearning for quiet tranquility, spending a weekend in the countryside is truly (27) ________ and refreshing.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nAgriculture in the Vietnamese countryside is undergoing a transformative modernization driven by digital technology and smart farming machinery. Gone are the days when farmers relied solely on muscle power and water buffaloes to till muddy paddy fields. Today, farmers in the Mekong Delta and Red River Delta utilize unmanned aerial vehicles (drones) equipped with smart sensors to spray organic fertilizers and monitor crop health from the sky. Automated irrigation systems measure soil moisture levels in real-time, delivering the precise amount of water needed without waste. Furthermore, agricultural cooperatives are utilizing smartphone applications to track market commodity prices and connect directly with urban supermarket chains. These technological advancements have dramatically elevated crop yields, lowered production expenses, and reduced heavy manual labor for farmers. Consequently, young educated people are increasingly returning to rural hometowns to launch innovative agricultural start-ups, breathing dynamic new life into pastoral communities.",
