      "sampleWritingText": "Life in the countryside provides many memorable experiences and benefits. The air is always fresh, peaceful, and unpolluted compared to busy cities. People live closely together, showing great hospitality and mutual support. In addition, teenagers in rural villages often enjoy outdoor activities like flying kites on grassy dikes, swimming in clear rivers, and riding bicycles around village lanes.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nKnitting and crochet have witnessed a remarkable resurgence among (23) ________ teenagers who appreciate slow, intentional crafting. The rhythmic, repetitive motion of looping woollen yarn over (24) ________ wooden needles induces a meditative mental calm similar to mindfulness yoga. Crafting handmade beanies, mittens, (25) ________ plush amigurumi toys requires focus on stitch counts and tension balance. Completing a wearable (26) ________ piece delivers a deep sense of creative accomplishment. This peaceful hobby proves that analog (27) ________ remain timelessly rewarding in our fast-moving world.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nCai Rang floating market in Can Tho presents an intoxicating explosion of vibrant sights, sounds, and aromas. Hundreds of wooden boats loaded with heaps of pineapples, watermelons, and mangoes cluster along the river at dawn. Each boat displays its agricultural goods on a tall bamboo pole called a cây bẹo so buyers can see offerings from afar. Breakfast vendors weave skillfully through the flotilla, serving steaming bowls of hu tieu noodles directly across boat gunwales. Experiencing this lively floating commerce provides an unforgettable cultural encounter.",
