      "audioScript": "🎧 Transcript bài nghe Part 1 (Hội thoại - 1 Giọng Nam, 1 Giọng Nữ):\nTom (Giọng Nam):\tHi Mai! Where did you go last weekend with your class?\nMai (Giọng Nữ):\tHello Tom! We had a wonderful field trip to Bat Trang pottery village near Ha Noi.\nTom (Giọng Nam):\tBat Trang? That sounds exciting! Did you try making any pottery yourself?\nMai (Giọng Nữ):\tYes! A local artisan guided us on how to mold wet clay on a spinning wheel to make a small bowl.\nTom (Giọng Nam):\tWas it difficult to shape the clay?\nMai (Giọng Nữ):\tIt required patience and steady hands, but it was so much fun. Crafting pottery helped me unwind and appreciate traditional handicrafts.\n\n🎧 Transcript bài nghe Part 2 (Độc thoại):\nDa Nang is widely celebrated as one of the most livable, modern, and beautiful cities in Viet Nam. Situated along the scenic central coast, the city combines stunning natural landscapes such as the Marble Mountains and Son Tra Peninsula with modern public infrastructure. The local government maintains clean streets, efficient electric bus transit, and beautiful sandy beaches. Furthermore, iconic landmarks like the Dragon Bridge, which breathes fire and water on weekend evenings, make Da Nang an attractive destination for visitors.",
      "writingRubric": "1. Mở đoạn (Topic sentence): 0.25đ\n2. Phát triển ý (Supporting sentences): 0.25đ\n3. Vốn từ vựng & cấu trúc ngữ pháp phong phú: 0.25đ\n4. Độ chính xác chính tả & ngữ pháp: 0.25đ. Tổng: 1.0 điểm.",
      "sampleWritingText": "Preserving traditional craft villages is of great importance for our cultural heritage. Bat Trang pottery village and Van Phuc silk village are vivid symbols of Vietnamese craftsmanship and history. Traditional crafts provide stable livelihoods for local artisans and attract tourists from all over the world. We should support local craft products and introduce them to international friends.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nEvery functional neighborhood relies on the tireless dedication of (23) ________ helpers who maintain public hygiene, safety, and order. Municipal waste collectors wake in the dead of (24) ________ to sweep roadways and clear overflowing waste dumpsters in all weather conditions. Neighborhood police officers patrol (25) ________ alleys to safeguard domestic peace, while firefighters risk their lives confronting blazing infernos. Recognizing the (26) ________ contributions of these unsung heroes fosters deep civic gratitude and social cohesion. A civilized (27) ________ treats all hardworking community contributors with profound dignity.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nThe relentless conversion of urban land into concrete high-rises and asphalt highways has created oppressive heat island' effects in metropolitan areas. Temperatures in concrete downtown corridors can soar up to six degrees higher than surrounding rural outskirts. To restore ecological balance, progressive cities are incorporating rooftop gardens, vertical green walls, and pocket public parks into urban architecture. Green vegetation purifies toxic air, lowers ambient temperatures, and provides vital psychological refuges for stressed citizens. Urban greening is an urgent environmental imperative.",
